{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the paws of Vesper Vaughn, a bold and agile Desert Mouse cursed with supernatural abilities and armed with a magical staff. Teleport across ancient ruins, leap over treacherous obstacles, and fend off lurking foes in a stylized 3D action-adventure platformer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504510/extras/6d4aacff98892a1b5008712cd3864215.poster.avif?t=1774121076\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504510/extras/6d4aacff98892a1b5008712cd3864215.webm?t=1774121076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504510/extras/6d4aacff98892a1b5008712cd3864215.mp4?t=1774121076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Staff Teleportation</strong> \u2013 Aim and throw your enchanted staff to special walls, then instantly warp to its location. Master clever angles and timing to outwit enemies or snag hidden collectibles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504510/extras/d0ed7be8bed5f50ac2cafa64d32fc8d8.poster.avif?t=1774121076\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504510/extras/d0ed7be8bed5f50ac2cafa64d32fc8d8.webm?t=1774121076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Combat</strong> \u2013 Slice through danger with swift melee strikes, or stun foes from afar by strategically launching your staff. Skillful combos and precise timing are crucial to surviving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504510/extras/3c910f9ebd842b098a40ef221dc28e32.poster.avif?t=1774121076\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504510/extras/3c910f9ebd842b098a40ef221dc28e32.webm?t=1774121076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504510/extras/3c910f9ebd842b098a40ef221dc28e32.mp4?t=1774121076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Agile Platforming</strong> \u2013 Double-jump, dash, and roll your way through perilous desert landscapes, crumbling ruins, and more. Every new level is packed with secrets to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504510/extras/4130e17cbdb3b8538ae8c74447982fbe.poster.avif?t=1774121076\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504510/extras/4130e17cbdb3b8538ae8c74447982fbe.webm?t=1774121076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504510/extras/4130e17cbdb3b8538ae8c74447982fbe.mp4?t=1774121076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle Exploration</strong> \u2013 Uncover the secrets of the Umbral Passage as you solve environmental puzzles and manipulate mirrors, shadows, and mystical relics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"